    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is <i>Saqer\u2019s Paradox</i>?</strong><br><i>Saqer\u2019s Paradox </i>is a 2.5D action-adventure RPG inspired by the puzzle-solving of <i>Four Swords Adventure</i> and the breathtaking HD pixel art of <i>Octopath Traveler</i>. It\u2019s a handcrafted love letter to pixel-art enthusiasts and classic RPG fans\u2014built from scratch with an original world, vision, and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673120/extras/0d5a6f57ea28eb3863cd745abdaf15a4.avif?t=1747712248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Conquer</strong><br>Delve into massive, atmospheric environments\u2014from ancient dungeons and awe-inspiring castles to towering enemies and sprawling ruins. Each level is meticulously designed to evoke scale and wonder, combining environmental storytelling with layered pixel depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673120/extras/a7b91e9a31105a45eb02a198ee828028.avif?t=1747712248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Precise Combat</strong><br>Battle in real time with tight, skill-based combat infused with strategic depth. Face off against colossal foes and tricky enemy patterns that reward timing, positioning, and mastery of your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673120/extras/7e0a667539b97f78730a3ab4f159fd88.avif?t=1747712248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built With Passion\u2014Pixel by Pixel</strong> <br>Every sprite, texture, and animation is hand-crafted\u2014no AI art, no stock assets, and no shortcuts. The pixel art is sharp, detailed, and animated with precision to capture the nostalgia of retro games while delivering modern polish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673120/extras/fa729ff02a2f1e98ebcabfbc32ac1146.avif?t=1747712248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original. Playable. Community-Driven.</strong><br><i>Saqer\u2019s Paradox\u00a0\u00a0</i>is 100% original\u2014no borrowed assets or IPs\u2014so you can support it without fear of takedowns. It is created solo over seven months by a full-time bank software engineer with no prior Unreal Engine experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673120/extras/633ba9aff6f97aa154d10a3d0a26206b.avif?t=1747712248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is <i>Saqer\u2019s Paradox</i>?</strong><br><i>Saqer\u2019s Paradox </i>is a 2.5D action-adventure RPG inspired by the puzzle-solving of <i>Four Swords Adventure</i> and the breathtaking HD pixel art of <i>Octopath Traveler</i>. It\u2019s a handcrafted love letter to pixel-art enthusiasts and classic RPG fans\u2014built from scratch with an original world, vision, and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673120/extras/0d5a6f57ea28eb3863cd745abdaf15a4.avif?t=1747712248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Conquer</strong><br>Delve into massive, atmospheric environments\u2014from ancient dungeons and awe-inspiring castles to towering enemies and sprawling ruins. Each level is meticulously designed to evoke scale and wonder, combining environmental storytelling with layered pixel depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673120/extras/a7b91e9a31105a45eb02a198ee828028.avif?t=1747712248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Precise Combat</strong><br>Battle in real time with tight, skill-based combat infused with strategic depth. Face off against colossal foes and tricky enemy patterns that reward timing, positioning, and mastery of your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673120/extras/7e0a667539b97f78730a3ab4f159fd88.avif?t=1747712248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built With Passion\u2014Pixel by Pixel</strong> <br>Every sprite, texture, and animation is hand-crafted\u2014no AI art, no stock assets, and no shortcuts. The pixel art is sharp, detailed, and animated with precision to capture the nostalgia of retro games while delivering modern polish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673120/extras/fa729ff02a2f1e98ebcabfbc32ac1146.avif?t=1747712248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original. Playable. Community-Driven.</strong><br><i>Saqer\u2019s Paradox\u00a0\u00a0</i>is 100% original\u2014no borrowed assets or IPs\u2014so you can support it without fear of takedowns. It is created solo over seven months by a full-time bank software engineer with no prior Unreal Engine experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673120/extras/633ba9aff6f97aa154d10a3d0a26206b.avif?t=1747712248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A hand-crafted 2.5D action-adventure RPG built with pixel-perfect love. Explore colossal castles, battle in real time, and solve intricate puzzles\u2014all in a gorgeous HD pixel world. Support and help bring Saqer\u2019s Paradox to life!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cA new legend, told in pixels\u2014with Octopath soul, Zelda spirit, and all the heart of a SNES-era epic\u201d<br>9.8/10 \u2013 Lord Pogg Gaming<br><br>\u201cHas to be seen to be believed\u201d<br>Sean Madson, Medium<br>",
